This work consists of wiseref.dtx, wiseref.ins, wiseref-en.tex,
wiseref-zh.tex, wiseref-example-en.tex, wiseref-example-zh.tex, build.lua,
Makefile, README.md, LICENSE, and the test scripts, fixtures,
and documentation under test/. The derived files are wiseref.sty,
wiseref-en.pdf, and wiseref-zh.pdf.

Local caches, build intermediates, and generated test results are not part
of the distributed work. See test/CTAN-RELEASE.md for the archive layout.
